{"seq":2,"slug":"direct-io-odirect-alignment-direct-descriptor","title":"磁盘 Direct IO：O_DIRECT 对齐约束、direct descriptor 与文件描述符模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/io-uring-linux-high-performance-async-io-engineering/network-disk-workloads-zerocopy/direct-io-odirect-alignment-direct-descriptor","wordCount":2496,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"磁盘-direct-io-o_direct-对齐约束-direct-descriptor-与文件描述符模式\">磁盘 Direct IO：O_DIRECT 对齐约束、direct descriptor 与文件描述符模式</h1><p>一个订单结算服务把日志追加写改成 <code>O_DIRECT</code> 之后，P99 反而从 1.2ms 涨到 8ms，<code>strace</code> 里满屏 <code>EINVAL</code>——原因是写偏移是 4KB 的倍数，但长度随消息大小变化，只有 37% 的请求满足块对齐，其余全被文件系统拒绝后由上层重试为 buffered 写。这类故障的共同点是：<code>O_DIRECT</code> 的对齐约束既不在 <code>open(2)</code> 时报错，也不在首次读时集中暴露，而是散落成零星的 <code>EINVAL</code>、短读、以及&quot;看起来生效其实退回页缓存&quot;的静默路径。本文讲透三件事：对齐约束到底约束哪几个量、怎么运行时探测它们、以及 io_uring 的 direct descriptor（直接描述符）如何把这套约束的成本压到最低。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>全文围绕三个可在代码中直接落地的概念展开，后续章节逐层展开其约束与组合方式。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>O_DIRECT</strong> —— <code>open(2)</code> 的打开标志，要求该 fd 上的读写绕过页缓存、直接与块设备做 DMA。它是一次「路径选择」而非性能承诺：省下的是页缓存拷贝与内存占用，付出的是对齐约束。</li>\n<li><strong>对齐约束</strong> —— 对缓冲区地址、文件内偏移、传输长度三者<strong>同时</strong>成立的整除关系；任一项不满足通常表现为 <code>EINVAL</code> 或短读，而非在 <code>open</code> 阶段集中报错。</li>\n<li><strong>direct descriptor</strong> —— 预先注册（<code>IORING_REGISTER_FILES</code>）或环内动态分配（<code>IORING_OP_OPENAT</code> + <code>IORING_FILE_INDEX_ALLOC</code>）的内核文件槽位；SQE 通过 <code>file_index</code> 引用它，热路径上省去文件表查找与引用计数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三者递进：<code>O_DIRECT</code> 定义 I/O 的<strong>路径</strong>，对齐约束是这条路径的<strong>准入条件</strong>，direct descriptor 把已经合规的请求在<strong>提交侧</strong>再压一次成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么高性能后端仍然要碰-o_direct\">为什么高性能后端仍然要碰 O_DIRECT</h2><p>页缓存对多数负载是净收益，但在三类工作负载上是负担。第一类是<strong>自带缓存层的存储引擎</strong>：MySQL InnoDB 用 <code>innodb_flush_method=O_DIRECT</code> 避免 buffer pool 与页缓存双重缓存同一批数据页，RocksDB 用 <code>use_direct_reads</code> 让压缩与刷盘不污染页缓存。第二类是<strong>顺序大块写</strong>：结算对账文件、物流轨迹归档这些数十 GB 的一次性写入，走页缓存只产生大量只写不改的脏页，最终被回写线程集中刷出形成抖动。第三类是<strong>确定性延迟</strong>：页缓存把&quot;是否命中&quot;变成随机变量，<code>O_DIRECT</code> 则把读延迟变成可预测的 DMA 时间，对 P99 有硬指标的服务价值明显。</p>\n<p><code>O_DIRECT</code> 的语义是<strong>绕过页缓存直接与块设备做 DMA</strong>（<code>open(2)</code> man page，man7.org）：它不保证更快，只保证&quot;不经过页缓存&quot;本身；代价是对缓冲区与 I/O 范围施加强对齐约束，这正是把它用对的分水岭。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对齐约束约束的是三个量-不是两个\">对齐约束约束的是三个量，不是两个</h2><p>最常见误解是&quot;O_DIRECT 只要 4KB 对齐即可&quot;。实际约束落在三个独立量上：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∣</mo><mtext>buf</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∣</mo><mtext>offset</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∣</mo><mtext>len</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_{mem} \\mid \\text{buf}, \\qquad a_{off} \\mid \\text{offset}, \\qquad a_{off} \\mid \\text{len}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">buf</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">offset</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">len</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><code>buf</code> 是缓冲区起始地址，<code>offset</code> 是文件内字节偏移，<code>len</code> 是传输长度；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_{mem}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是内存对齐要求，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_{off}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是偏移/长度对齐要求。<strong>长度也要对齐</strong>——最容易被忽略的一条：偏移对齐、缓冲区页对齐，但 <code>len</code> 是 5123 字节，多数文件系统上依然 <code>EINVAL</code>。第三个量源于块设备的传输单位：内核需把 I/O 切成整数个逻辑块交给设备。</p>\n<p>对齐值不是常量，而是<strong>由文件系统与该文件所在块设备共同决定</strong>。下表为工程上最常见的对照（数值取决于设备与内核，务必运行时探测而非硬编码）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文件系统 / 设备</th>\n<th>典型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_{mem}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>典型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_{off}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ext4（512B 逻辑块设备上）</td>\n<td>无强制要求</td>\n<td>512</td>\n<td>历史上对内存地址宽松，多数内核接受任意地址</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>XFS</td>\n<td>512</td>\n<td>512</td>\n<td>支持按 inode 报告对齐要求，可能因实时/大页特性不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>块设备直读 <code>/dev/nvme0n1</code></td>\n<td>512 或 4096</td>\n<td>逻辑块大小</td>\n<td>大页与 NVMe 常见 4096，须查 <code>logical_block_size</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络/叠加文件系统</td>\n<td>视实现</td>\n<td>视实现</td>\n<td>FUSE、overlayfs 上语义可能不完整</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"运行时探测-statx_dioalign-与-statx-2\">运行时探测：STATX_DIOALIGN 与 statx(2)</h2><p>硬编码 512 或 4096 必然在某类文件系统上翻车。内核从 Linux 6.1 起提供了查询手段：<code>statx(2)</code> 的 <code>STATX_DIOALIGN</code> 掩码会在 <code>struct statx</code> 中回填两个字段。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>stx_dio_mem_align</code> —— 内存缓冲区对齐要求；<strong>值为 0 表示无对齐要求</strong>（任意字节对齐均可），不是&quot;不支持 direct IO&quot;。</li>\n<li><code>stx_dio_offset_align</code> —— 偏移与长度对齐要求，通常等于文件系统的块大小。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>XFS 与 ext4 从 6.1 起支持该统计字段，其中 XFS 按 inode 报告。探测代码应是&quot;能探测就探测、失败则回退保守值&quot;的两级结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"struct statx stx;&#10;int rc = statx(fd, &quot;&quot;, AT_EMPTY_PATH | AT_STATX_DONT_SYNC,&#10;               STATX_DIOALIGN, &amp;stx);&#10;unsigned mem_align, off_align;&#10;if (rc == 0 &amp;&amp; (stx.stx_attributes_mask &amp; STATX_DIOALIGN)) {&#10;    mem_align = stx.stx_dio_mem_align;      /* 0 = 无要求 */&#10;    off_align = stx.stx_dio_offset_align;&#10;} else {&#10;    /* 6.1 之前、或文件系统未实现：保守取设备逻辑块大小 */&#10;    mem_align = 512;&#10;    off_align = blksize_of(fd);              /* BLKSSZGET 或 st_blksize */&#10;}&#10;if (off_align == 0) off_align = 512;&#10;if (mem_align == 0) mem_align = 1;            /* 任意对齐 */\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> statx stx;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> statx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fd, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, AT_EMPTY_PATH </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AT_STATX_DONT_SYNC,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">               STATX_DIOALIGN, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">stx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">unsigned</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mem_align, off_align;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (rc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (stx.stx_attributes_mask </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> STATX_DIOALIGN)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mem_align </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stx.stx_dio_mem_align;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      /* 0 = 无要求 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    off_align </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stx.stx_dio_offset_align;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    /* 6.1 之前、或文件系统未实现：保守取设备逻辑块大小 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mem_align </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    off_align </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> blksize_of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fd);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">              /* BLKSSZGET 或 st_blksize */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (off_align </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) off_align </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (mem_align </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) mem_align </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            /* 任意对齐 */</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>stx_dio_offset_align == 0</code> 表示&quot;该文件不支持 <code>O_DIRECT</code>&quot;（或信息不可用），此时应放弃 direct 路径而非继续尝试。相关字段定义见 <code>statx(2)</code> man page（man7.org）与内核 UAPI 头 <code>linux/stat.h</code>。</p>\n<p>缓冲区一侧，<code>mem_align</code> 是 512/4096 时用 <code>posix_memalign</code> / <code>aligned_alloc</code> 分配，需要页对齐或大页时用 <code>mmap</code> 配 <code>MAP_HUGETLB</code>。跨语言场景要提防运行时分配器：Go 的 <code>make([]byte, n)</code> 只保证 8 字节对齐，做 <code>O_DIRECT</code> 必须显式分配页对齐切片；Java 需 <code>ByteBuffer.allocateDirect</code> 并核对地址对齐。</p>\n<h2 id=\"失败的表现形态与诊断顺序\">失败的表现形态与诊断顺序</h2><p>对齐不合规时，行为按文件系统分成三类，这也是定位困难的根源：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>典型文件系统</th>\n<th>危害</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>open</code>/<code>read</code>/<code>write</code> 直接返回 <code>EINVAL</code></td>\n<td>ext4、XFS</td>\n<td>最良性，错误点明确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>返回<strong>短读</strong>（部分字节完成）</td>\n<td>部分实现与旧内核</td>\n<td>调用方需重试未完成区间，易被当成完整读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静默退回 buffered 或返回非预期长度</td>\n<td>叠加/网络文件系统</td>\n<td>最危险：性能假设失效但无任何报错</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>诊断顺序建议固定为四步：(1) <code>statx</code> 打印实际对齐值；(2) 校验缓冲区地址、偏移、长度三者是否都满足；(3) 用 <code>strace</code> 观察真实返回码与长度；(4) 用 <code>fio --direct=1</code> 复现。把 <code>EINVAL</code> 与短读一并统计进指标——很多框架把 <code>EINVAL</code> 降级为内部重试，指标上看不出异常。</p>\n<h2 id=\"direct-descriptor-把文件表查找从热路径上摘掉\">direct descriptor：把文件表查找从热路径上摘掉</h2><p><code>O_DIRECT</code> 解决了页缓存，但 io_uring 的每次请求仍要按 <code>fd</code> 在进程文件表中做一次查找与引用计数。direct descriptor 把这步预计算掉：用 <code>IORING_REGISTER_FILES</code> 一次性把一批 <code>fd</code> 注册进内核，之后每个 SQE 设 <code>IOSQE_FIXED_FILE</code>、把 <code>sqe-&gt;fd</code> 换成 <code>sqe-&gt;file_index</code>，内核直接按索引取 <code>struct file *</code>。注册是 O(n) 的一次性成本，在长连接、高 IOPS 场景摊薄后收益显著。</p>\n<p>更彻底的模式是<strong>不预先持有真实 fd</strong>——用 <code>IORING_OP_OPENAT</code>（或 <code>IORING_OP_OPENAT2</code>，Linux 5.15+）在环内打开文件，并在 <code>sqe-&gt;file_index</code> 填 <code>IORING_FILE_INDEX_ALLOC</code>，让内核为该请求<strong>动态分配槽位</strong>。配合 <code>IOSQE_IO_LINK</code> 把 open 与随后的 read/write 链起来，&quot;打开—读—关闭&quot;序列可以完全不产生真实描述符。可用槽位区间由 <code>IORING_REGISTER_FILE_ALLOC_RANGE</code>（Linux 6.0+）划定；把直接描述符转回真实 fd 的 <code>IORING_OP_FIXED_FD_INSTALL</code> 在 Linux 6.8 引入，用于把 fd 交给 <code>sendfile</code>、<code>epoll</code> 等子系统的场合。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;应用准备 I/O 请求&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;文件是否已注册?&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| C[&quot;sqe-&amp;gt;file_index 指向直接描述符&lt;br/&gt;设置 IOSQE_FIXED_FILE&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;否,且需动态打开&quot;| D[&quot;IORING_OP_OPENAT&lt;br/&gt;file_index = IORING_FILE_INDEX_ALLOC&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;IOSQE_IO_LINK 链接后续 op&lt;br/&gt;内核动态分配槽位&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt; G[&quot;内核查 O_DIRECT 对齐&lt;br/&gt;STATX_DIOALIGN 约束&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt;|&quot;对齐合规&quot;| H[&quot;DMA 直传,绕过页缓存&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt;|&quot;不合规&quot;| I[&quot;EINVAL / 短读,调用方重试&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; J[&quot;写 CQE,user_data 回传&quot;]&#10;  I --&gt; J\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"应用准备 I/O 请求\"] --&gt; B{\"文件是否已注册?\"}\n  B --&gt;|\"是\"| C[\"sqe-&amp;gt;file_index 指向直接描述符&lt;br/&gt;设置 IOSQE_FIXED_FILE\"]\n  B --&gt;|\"否,且需动态打开\"| D[\"IORING_OP_OPENAT&lt;br/&gt;file_index = IORING_FILE_INDEX_ALLOC\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"IOSQE_IO_LINK 链接后续 op&lt;br/&gt;内核动态分配槽位\"]\n  E --&gt; C\n  C --&gt; G[\"内核查 O_DIRECT 对齐&lt;br/&gt;STATX_DIOALIGN 约束\"]\n  G --&gt;|\"对齐合规\"| H[\"DMA 直传,绕过页缓存\"]\n  G --&gt;|\"不合规\"| I[\"EINVAL / 短读,调用方重试\"]\n  H --&gt; J[\"写 CQE,user_data 回传\"]\n  I --&gt; J</pre><p>容量上有一个边界要记住：注册文件表受 <code>RLIMIT_NOFILE</code> 约束（<code>io_uring_register(2)</code> man page），&quot;注册几万条 fd&quot;通常需同步调高该限制——这不是 io_uring 的 bug，而是资源额度问题。另外 <code>IORING_REGISTER_FILES_UPDATE</code> 能替换单个槽位而不重建整表，适合连接池里 fd 滚动失效的场景，重建整表会打断在途请求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"组合配方-o_direct-direct-descriptor-注册缓冲区\">组合配方：O_DIRECT + direct descriptor + 注册缓冲区</h2><p>三个机制叠加才是完整的高性能 direct IO 路径。注册缓冲区（<code>IORING_REGISTER_BUFFERS</code> + <code>IORING_OP_READ_FIXED</code> / <code>WRITE_FIXED</code>）省掉每次请求的页映射与散列表建立，代价是缓冲区必须在注册时确定且不能同时被别处改动。三者组合后约束是<strong>叠加的</strong>：缓冲区既要满足注册缓冲区的页面要求，又要满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_{mem}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，长度既要满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_{off}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 又要落在注册区间内。一条可复用的工程路径：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>启动时 <code>statx</code> 探测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_{mem}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_{off}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，失败则回退到 <code>BLKSSZGET</code> 的逻辑块大小。</li>\n<li>按 <code>max(a_mem, pagesize)</code> 分配并整页对齐缓冲区；走注册缓冲区时额外按大页对齐。</li>\n<li>把长度<strong>向上取整到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a\\_{off}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的整数倍</strong>，尾部填充不计入业务语义；读取时按真实长度截断，写入时若文件尾不许空洞则最后一块退回 buffered 写。</li>\n<li>长生命周期 fd 用 <code>IORING_REGISTER_FILES</code> 注册，短期文件用 <code>OPENAT + IOSQE_IO_LINK + IORING_FILE_INDEX_ALLOC</code> 走动态槽位。</li>\n<li>CI 里用 <code>fio --direct=1 --ioengine=io_uring --bs=4k,8k,16k</code> 覆盖多种块长，确认零 <code>EINVAL</code>、零短读，并对比 buffered 的 P99。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>最后一个反直觉的坑：<strong>对齐满足了也并不代表 direct 生效</strong>。在叠加文件系统（overlayfs、部分容器存储驱动）上，底层文件系统的 <code>O_DIRECT</code> 语义可能被吞掉而退回 buffered，此时 <code>statx</code> 报出的对齐值是上层值。验证方法是在目标挂载点上跑 <code>fio --direct=1</code> 并核对 <code>/proc/diskstats</code> 的块设备计数是否与请求量匹配——只有块设备层面看到对应流量，才能确认确实绕过了页缓存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p><code>O_DIRECT</code> 的价值来自「绕过页缓存」这一路径选择，能否走通取决于缓冲区地址、文件偏移、传输长度三个量是否同时满足文件系统与块设备的对齐要求。正确姿势是<strong>运行时探测而非硬编码</strong>：Linux 6.1 起用 <code>statx(2)</code> 的 <code>STATX_DIOALIGN</code> 读取 <code>stx_dio_mem_align</code> 与 <code>stx_dio_offset_align</code>，探测失败则回退到块设备逻辑块大小。direct descriptor 把这套已经合规的请求在提交侧再压一层成本。三者叠加、辅以 <code>fio --direct=1</code> 与 <code>/proc/diskstats</code> 的端到端验证，才能确认 direct IO 确实生效，而非被静默退回 buffered。</p>\n<p>延伸阅读：本 hub 内可继续阅读 <a href=\"../uring-ring-sqe-cqe-mechanics/shared-ring-mmap-sq-cq-layout-entries\">共享环内存布局与 SQE/CQE 提交协议</a> 了解 <code>IOSQE_IO_LINK</code> 与 <code>IOSQE_FIXED_FILE</code> 在 SQE 中的确切位置，以及 <a href=\"../io-model-evolution-syscall-cost/syscall-context-switch-copy-overhead-model\">系统调用、上下文切换与拷贝开销模型</a> 理解为什么省下一次文件表查找与一次内存拷贝在 P99 上量级可观。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"磁盘 Direct IO：O_DIRECT 对齐约束、direct descriptor 与文件描述符模式","id":"磁盘-direct-io-o_direct-对齐约束-direct-descriptor-与文件描述符模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么高性能后端仍然要碰 O_DIRECT","id":"为什么高性能后端仍然要碰-o_direct"},{"level":2,"text":"对齐约束约束的是三个量，不是两个","id":"对齐约束约束的是三个量-不是两个"},{"level":2,"text":"运行时探测：STATX_DIOALIGN 与 statx(2)","id":"运行时探测-statx_dioalign-与-statx-2"},{"level":2,"text":"失败的表现形态与诊断顺序","id":"失败的表现形态与诊断顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"direct descriptor：把文件表查找从热路径上摘掉","id":"direct-descriptor-把文件表查找从热路径上摘掉"},{"level":2,"text":"组合配方：O_DIRECT + direct descriptor + 注册缓冲区","id":"组合配方-o_direct-direct-descriptor-注册缓冲区"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"网络工作负载：recv/send multishot、provide buffers 与 accept 批量投递","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/io-uring-linux-high-performance-async-io-engineering/network-disk-workloads-zerocopy/network-recv-send-multishot-provide-buffers"},"next":{"title":"零拷贝与固定缓冲：sendmsg ZC、registered buffers/files 的注册生命周期与异常","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/io-uring-linux-high-performance-async-io-engineering/network-disk-workloads-zerocopy/zerocopy-sendmsg-fixed-buffers-registered-iovec"}}